  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.9</data>
  <data key="d37">Interruptions at maritime chokepoints or wartime rerouting increase transit times and port congestion for Europe-bound shipments, directly raising the level and persistence of supply-chain disruptions.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_regional_war</data>
  <data key="d40">europe_hybrid_threats</data>
