  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Maritime route interruptions force firms to accelerate procurement from substitute or secondary suppliers with shorter vetting cycles, increasing the likelihood of integrating hardware/software with weaker provenance and raising information-security vulnerabilities.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_regional_war</data>
