  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">A rising perceived risk of regional escalation motivates NATO/EU partners to synchronize diplomatic positions, contingency planning and force-posture decisions, increasing short-term policy alignment.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
