  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">A rapid surge in unverified reporting and rumor about the conflict overloads liaison channels and analytic pipelines, delaying validation and reducing the timeliness and operational utility of shared intelligence.</data>
