  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.9</data>
  <data key="d37">An increase in coordinated hybrid operations (kinetic strikes, drone swarms, sabotage and proxy actions) directly raises the number of offensive launches and physical attacks against energy and urban infrastructure in chokepoint regions.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">global_energy_chokepoint</data>
</edge>
