  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Improved investor sentiment toward tech-sector firms increases capital availability for component manufacturers and logistics providers, reducing insolvencies and production stoppages that would otherwise produce interruptions in European supply chains.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d40">europe_hybrid_threats</data>
