  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">A deterioration in investor sentiment toward firms exposed to the tech rivalry tightens capital and credit for maintenance and resilience projects at chokepoint facilities, increasing the probability of supply-disrupting failures or deferred upgrades.</data>
