  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Improved, integrated defenses around chokepoints reduce the operational payoff of coordinated kinetic-plus-information campaigns, lowering incentives for actors to mount large-scale hybrid operations that rely on creating physical disruption as a force multiplier.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_energy_chokepoint</data>
