  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Improved interception and defense performance lowers the chance that individual attacks achieve significant effect, reducing incentives for immediate retaliatory escalation and lowering perceived short‑term escalation risk.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
