  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Significant physical damage to energy and port infrastructure raises near-term costs (insurance, rerouting, downtime) and directly downgrades earnings outlooks for exposed firms, triggering negative investor sentiment in sectors tied to US–China tech supply chains.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_energy_chokepoint</data>
